  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Credo Bank: Enhancing Rural Livelihoods, Food Security, and Rural Financial Service Coverage</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The technical assistance (TA) is attached to a proposed loan for the Credo Bank Supporting Food Security through Inclusive Access to Finance Project. The Asian Development Bank (ADB) will provide long-term financing in local currency to Credo Bank JSC (Credo) for onlending to rural micro, small, and medium-sized enterprises (MSMEs).</narrative>
  </description>
